Vendor Due Diligence and DPA Drafting
Objectives
By completing this lab, you will:

Build and score a vendor security questionnaire against a control baseline using CLI tools
Parse vendor responses programmatically to identify compliance gaps
Draft DPA clauses covering GDPR Art. 28, UAE PDPL, and KSA PDPL sub-processor requirements
Create a cross-border transfer addendum for GCC-to-international data flows
Build a remediation tracker with status automation using shell scripting and Markdown/CSV
Prerequisites
Basic Linux CLI familiarity (bash, file editing with nano/vim)
Basic understanding of GDPR Article 28, UAE PDPL, KSA PDPL concepts
Python 3 installed (for parsing script)
No prior DPA drafting experience required
