Troubleshooting
Script errors on empty CSV fields: ensure no trailing commas/blank rows in the source CSV
json.load fails: validate baseline.json syntax with python3 -m json.tool baseline.json
Date math errors in Python: ensure datetime.timedelta receives integer days, not strings
Conclusion
In this lab, you performed an end-to-end vendor due diligence and DPA drafting exercise. You created a security questionnaire, simulated vendor responses, and built a Python-based gap analysis tool to score responses against a compliance baseline. You then drafted DPA clauses addressing GDPR Article 28 sub-processor flow-down obligations, incorporated UAE PDPL and KSA PDPL requirements, and authored a cross-border transfer addendum addressing non-adequate destination countries identified during review. Finally, you built an automated remediation tracker to manage identified gaps with severity-based due dates. These skills directly support Vendor Risk Manager and Privacy Counsel responsibilities and align with IAPP CIPM competencies in third-party risk management.
